Subject: [PATCH 0146/1695] drivers: clk-stm32mp15: add the operating point
 support

MPU can operate at various clock/voltage values. A set of PLL1
configuration value can be defined. Add the functions to manage
the PLL frequency update and the associated OPP settings.

